Begin Exploring Related Columns
column name: potential usage  
• LANGUAGES."repo_name": identify the repository to be (later) joined with file / content tables  
• LANGUAGES."language": exclude repositories whose language array / string contains “python” (case‑insensitive)  
• SAMPLE_FILES."repo_name": keep only files that belong to repositories surviving the language filter  
• SAMPLE_FILES."path": find files whose path string includes “readme.md” (case‑insensitive)  
• SAMPLE_FILES."id": connect a file‑row with its full text that sits in SAMPLE_CONTENTS  
• SAMPLE_CONTENTS."id": join key coming from SAMPLE_FILES."id"  
• SAMPLE_CONTENTS."content": look for the phrase “Copyright (c)” (case‑insensitive) inside the file body  
• SAMPLE_CONTENTS."sample_repo_name": second way to join back to LANGUAGES if desired (same value as repo_name)  

Typical conditions that may be used  
1. LANGUAGES."language" ILIKE '%python%'  → repositories to be filtered‑out  
2. SAMPLE_FILES."path" ILIKE '%readme.md%'  
3. SAMPLE_CONTENTS."content" ILIKE '%copyright %(c)%'

Below are 10 exploratory Snowflake SQL queries (from very simple to nearly the final calculation).  
All identifiers are enclosed in double quotes; every query ends with LIMIT 20 just for sampling.

```sql
--Q1---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Show some rows from the LANGUAGES table where the language text
--             obviously contains “python” (case‑insensitive check).
SELECT *
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES"
WHERE "language" ILIKE '%python%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q2---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: List 20 distinct repositories whose language list / string does
--             NOT reference python in any way.
SELECT DISTINCT "repo_name"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES"
WHERE "language" NOT ILIKE '%python%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q3---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Show 20 file paths that look like README files (contain “readme.md”).
SELECT "repo_name",
       "path",
       "id"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_FILES"
WHERE "path" ILIKE '%readme.md%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q4---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Display 20 contents that have the phrase “Copyright (c)”.
SELECT "sample_repo_name",
       "sample_path",
       "id",
       LEFT("content", 300) AS "snippet"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_CONTENTS"
WHERE "content" ILIKE '%copyright %(c)%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q5---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Join SAMPLE_FILES and SAMPLE_CONTENTS on “id” to see whether the
--             detected README files indeed hold a Copyright (c).
SELECT f."repo_name",
       f."path",
       LEFT(c."content", 200) AS "snippet"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_FILES"  AS f
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_CONTENTS" AS c
  ON f."id" = c."id"
WHERE f."path" ILIKE '%readme.md%'
  AND c."content" ILIKE '%copyright %(c)%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q6---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Bring in the language restriction – keep only repos that do NOT
--             advertise python anywhere in their language list.
SELECT f."repo_name",
       f."path",
       LEFT(c."content", 200) AS "snippet"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_FILES"  AS f
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_CONTENTS" AS c
  ON f."id" = c."id"
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES" AS l
  ON f."repo_name" = l."repo_name"
WHERE l."language" NOT ILIKE '%python%'
  AND f."path" ILIKE '%readme.md%'
  AND c."content" ILIKE '%copyright %(c)%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q7---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Count README.md files (for python‑free repos) whose content
--             contains the target phrase – sample results.
SELECT COUNT(*) AS "readme_with_copyright"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_FILES"  AS f
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_CONTENTS" AS c
  ON f."id" = c."id"
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES" AS l
  ON f."repo_name" = l."repo_name"
WHERE l."language" NOT ILIKE '%python%'
  AND f."path" ILIKE '%readme.md%'
  AND c."content" ILIKE '%copyright %(c)%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q8---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Count ALL files (any path) that live in python‑free repositories
--             so we can form a denominator later.
SELECT COUNT(*) AS "all_files_in_python_free_repos"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_FILES"  AS f
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES" AS l
  ON f."repo_name" = l."repo_name"
WHERE l."language" NOT ILIKE '%python%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q9---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Aggregate both numerator and denominator in one shot.
SELECT
  COUNT_IF(    f."path" ILIKE '%readme.md%'
           AND c."content" ILIKE '%copyright %(c)%') AS "match_count",
  COUNT(*)                                        AS "total_files"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_FILES"  AS f
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES" AS l
  ON f."repo_name" = l."repo_name"
LEFT JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_CONTENTS" AS c
  ON f."id" = c."id"
WHERE l."language" NOT ILIKE '%python%'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--Q10---------------------------------------------------------------------------
--Description: Compute the proportion of files (as required) – final formula.
SELECT
  SAFE_DIVIDE(
      COUNT_IF(    f."path" ILIKE '%readme.md%'
               AND c."content" ILIKE '%copyright %(c)%'),
      COUNT(*)
  ) AS "proportion_readme_with_copyright"
FROM "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_FILES"  AS f
JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."LANGUAGES" AS l
  ON f."repo_name" = l."repo_name"
LEFT JOIN "GITHUB_REPOS"."GITHUB_REPOS"."SAMPLE_CONTENTS" AS c
  ON f."id" = c."id"
WHERE l."language" NOT ILIKE '%python%'
LIMIT 20;
```

